{"seq":3,"slug":"inventory-health-category-dashboard","title":"品类/仓库健康看板与改善跟踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/recommendation-dashboard/inventory-health-category-dashboard","wordCount":1986,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"品类-仓库健康看板与改善跟踪\">品类/仓库健康看板与改善跟踪</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>诊断、预警、建议各自产出数据，但只有<strong>看板</strong>把它们合成一个可以被组织共同讨论的界面。看板的设计目标不是「展示尽可能多的指标」，而是<strong>让一次会议能在十分钟内决定三件事</strong>：哪个单元最差、差在哪里、上周的动作有没有效果。指标越多，会议越长且越没有结论。</p>\n<p>看板的结构应遵循<strong>三层金字塔</strong>：顶层是分档结果（红黄绿灯与改善清单），中层是维度分解（周转/库龄/呆滞/服务/资金），底层是明细与证据（SKU 清单、批次库龄、动作流水）。三层之间必须能一键下钻，且下钻后能解释上一层的数值来源——这正是 <a href=\"../inventory-health-metric/health-score-redyellow-green\">库存健康度评分</a> 的贡献度分解在看板上的呈现。</p>\n<p>看板与报表的区别在于<strong>跟踪</strong>。一份静态报表回答「现在怎样」，看板要回答「比上周怎样、比目标怎样、动作生效了没有」。因此看板的每个单元都必须有<strong>基准线</strong>与<strong>时间序列</strong>，而不只是当前值。基准线的来源有三类：目标值（策略设定）、上期值（环比）、去年同期（同比，用于识别季节性）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[数据层] --&gt; B[诊断指标&lt;br/&gt;DIO/库龄/呆滞/服务]&#10;  A --&gt; C[动作流水&lt;br/&gt;建议/告警/执行结果]&#10;  A --&gt; D[财务口径&lt;br/&gt;资金占用/拨备]&#10;  B --&gt; E[聚合层&lt;br/&gt;品类/仓/区域]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[评分与分档&lt;br/&gt;红黄绿灯]&#10;  F --&gt; G[顶层视图&lt;br/&gt;改善清单]&#10;  E --&gt; H[中层视图&lt;br/&gt;维度分解]&#10;  E --&gt; I[底层视图&lt;br/&gt;SKU 明细 + 证据]&#10;  G --&gt; J[周会决议]&#10;  H --&gt; J&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt; K[动作下发]&#10;  K --&gt; C\">graph TD\n  A[数据层] --&gt; B[诊断指标&lt;br/&gt;DIO/库龄/呆滞/服务]\n  A --&gt; C[动作流水&lt;br/&gt;建议/告警/执行结果]\n  A --&gt; D[财务口径&lt;br/&gt;资金占用/拨备]\n  B --&gt; E[聚合层&lt;br/&gt;品类/仓/区域]\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[评分与分档&lt;br/&gt;红黄绿灯]\n  F --&gt; G[顶层视图&lt;br/&gt;改善清单]\n  E --&gt; H[中层视图&lt;br/&gt;维度分解]\n  E --&gt; I[底层视图&lt;br/&gt;SKU 明细 + 证据]\n  G --&gt; J[周会决议]\n  H --&gt; J\n  I --&gt; J\n  J --&gt; K[动作下发]\n  K --&gt; C</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>视图层</th>\n<th>主要读者</th>\n<th>刷新频率</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n<th>下钻目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>顶层</td>\n<td>供应链/财务负责人</td>\n<td>周</td>\n<td>红黄绿灯、改善清单、资金占用总额</td>\n<td>品类/仓明细</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中层</td>\n<td>品类经理</td>\n<td>日</td>\n<td>五维分解、与目标差距、动作进度</td>\n<td>SKU 清单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>底层</td>\n<td>品类运营、库存专员</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n<td>SKU 库龄批次、告警状态、建议流水</td>\n<td>批次/单据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>财务视图</td>\n<td>财务 BP</td>\n<td>月</td>\n<td>资金占用、持有成本、跌价准备</td>\n<td>SKU 拨备明细</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"指标集的取舍\">指标集的取舍</h2><h3 id=\"五维核心指标\">五维核心指标</h3><p>看板的中层只放五类指标，与评分维度一一对应：<strong>周转</strong>（DIO 与目标比值）、<strong>库龄结构</strong>（90 天以上金额占比）、<strong>呆滞</strong>（呆滞金额占比与状态分布）、<strong>服务</strong>（可售率、缺货 SKU 占比、缺货与超储并存天数占比）、<strong>资金</strong>（资金占用金额与预算比、金额加权平均持有天数）。这五类覆盖了 <a href=\"../inventory-health-metric/age-bucket-dio-turnover\">库龄分布与 DIO</a>、<a href=\"../obsolete-excess-detect/slowmoving-deadstock-rule-alert\">呆滞识别</a>、<a href=\"../obsolete-excess-detect/safety-stock-excess-stockout\">并存诊断</a>、<a href=\"../capital-attribution/inventory-carrying-cost-capital\">资金占用</a> 的全部输出。</p>\n<h3 id=\"指标必须带口径说明\">指标必须带口径说明</h3><p>跨境看板最容易出的争议是「你我的 DIO 不一样」。看板上每个指标都必须能展开显示：<strong>分子口径、分母口径、时间窗口、是否含在途、汇率口径、成本口径（落地成本 vs FOB）</strong>。这六项写清楚，会议里一半的争论会自动消失。口径说明不是附注，它是看板的组成部分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"避免的指标\">避免的指标</h3><p>看板应主动排除三类指标：<strong>不可归因的合成指标</strong>（如「库存综合指数」，没人知道该调哪一项）、<strong>与决策无关的虚荣指标</strong>（如总 SKU 数）、<strong>依赖单一数据源的脆弱指标</strong>（如只有系统账面数据、没有实物盘点校准的准确率）。第三类尤其危险——它会给出虚假的确定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"改善跟踪的机制\">改善跟踪的机制</h2><h3 id=\"动作流水与效果的关联\">动作流水与效果的关联</h3><p>改善跟踪的本质是<strong>把动作流水与指标变化在时间轴上对齐</strong>。每一条来自 <a href=\"../recommendation-dashboard/transfer-promotion-markdown-suggest\">建议层</a> 的建议、每一条来自 <a href=\"inventory-alert-owner-workflow\">告警闭环</a> 的处理任务，都应该在看板上占据一个时间点，其后的指标变化可以归因到它（或证明没有效果）。</p>\n<p>关键工程要求是<strong>反事实基线</strong>：评估一个清仓动作的效果，不能只看清仓后库存降了多少，还要看「如果不做，库存会怎样」。最简单可用的反事实是<strong>同类对照</strong>：取同品类同库龄但未被处置的 SKU 作为对照组。这比复杂的因果推断更容易落地，且足以识别「动作只是搭了季节性需求的顺风车」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"效果验证的窗口\">效果验证的窗口</h3><p>动作效果必须在一个<strong>预设窗口</strong>后验证，窗口长度由品类动销周期决定（快消 14–28 天，时尚 42–56 天，家具 90–120 天）。窗口太短会把噪音当效果，太长则失去纠错机会。验证结果分三类：<strong>达标</strong>（指标改善且归因可辨）、<strong>未达标</strong>（无改善或恶化）、<strong>无法判定</strong>（多重因素交织，样本不足）。第三类必须显式存在，强行归因比不归因更危险。</p>\n<h3 id=\"改善的复利-把有效动作沉淀为规则\">改善的复利：把有效动作沉淀为规则</h3><p>一次有效的处置不应只解决一个 SKU。看板要支持<strong>从个案到规则的提炼</strong>：某个阈值的调整、某类 SKU 的处置模板、某个供应商的退货条款，都应从个案中提炼为可复用规则。这对应 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DMAIC\">DMAIC</a> 的 Control 阶段——该来源要求「embed the changes and ensure sustainability」，其手段包括控制图、标准程序与收益跟踪。没有 Control，改善就是一轮又一轮的重复劳动。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH action_effect AS (&#10;  SELECT a.suggestion_id, a.sku_id, a.category_id, a.action_type,&#10;         a.generated_at, a.executed_at,&#10;         a.delta_cash AS predicted_delta_cash,&#10;         m.baseline_metric, m.post_metric,&#10;         m.recheck_window_days&#10;  FROM fact_action_suggestion a&#10;  JOIN action_effect_metrics m ON m.suggestion_id = a.suggestion_id&#10;  WHERE a.status = &#39;DONE&#39;&#10;    AND m.recheck_date &lt;= CURRENT_DATE&#10;),&#10;scored AS (&#10;  SELECT *,&#10;    (baseline_metric - post_metric) AS actual_improvement,&#10;    CASE&#10;      WHEN actual_improvement &gt;= 0.8 * (baseline_metric - 0) THEN &#39;MET&#39;&#10;      WHEN actual_improvement &lt;= 0 THEN &#39;NOT_MET&#39;&#10;      ELSE &#39;PARTIAL&#39;&#10;    END AS outcome&#10;  FROM action_effect&#10;)&#10;SELECT category_id, action_type,&#10;       COUNT(*)                                        AS actions,&#10;       ROUND(AVG(CASE WHEN outcome = &#39;MET&#39; THEN 1 ELSE 0 END), 3) AS met_rate,&#10;       SUM(predicted_delta_cash)                        AS predicted_cash,&#10;       SUM(predicted_delta_cash) FILTER (WHERE outcome = &#39;MET&#39;) AS realized_cash,&#10;       ROUND(AVG(actual_improvement), 2)               AS avg_improvement&#10;FROM scored&#10;GROUP BY category_id, action_type&#10;ORDER BY actions DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> action_effect </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">suggestion_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">category_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">action_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">generated_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">executed_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">delta_cash</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> predicted_delta_cash,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">baseline_metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">post_metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">recheck_window_days</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fact_action_suggestion a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> action_effect_metrics m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">suggestion_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">suggestion_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DONE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">recheck_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scored </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (baseline_metric </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> post_metric) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actual_improvement,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actual_improvement </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (baseline_metric </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'MET'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actual_improvement </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'NOT_MET'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PARTIAL'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outcome</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> action_effect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> category_id, action_type,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actions,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outcome </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'MET'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> met_rate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(predicted_delta_cash)                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> predicted_cash,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(predicted_delta_cash) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outcome </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'MET'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> realized_cash,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(actual_improvement), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)               </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_improvement</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scored</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> category_id, action_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这张查询给出的是<strong>建议层的成绩单</strong>：哪类动作在哪个品类的达成率高、预估回收现金与实际回收现金的差距。它是建议层参数校准的直接输入——若某品类的清仓建议达成率长期偏低，说明该品类的 <code>min_gross_margin_pct</code> 或 <code>max_discount_step_pct</code> 设得不合理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组织节奏与会议设计\">组织节奏与会议设计</h2><h3 id=\"三个节奏\">三个节奏</h3><p>看板服务于三个不同的会议节奏：<strong>日会</strong>（15 分钟，只看 P1 告警与昨日动作）、<strong>周会</strong>（60 分钟，看五维分解与改善清单进展）、<strong>月度经营会</strong>（看资金占用与拨备，含财务口径）。三个节奏共用同一份数据、不同粒度的视图——若三个会议各自维护一套数字，组织的时间会大量消耗在对数上。</p>\n<h3 id=\"目标设定的规范化\">目标设定的规范化</h3><p>周会上设定的改善目标应符合 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SMART_criteria\">SMART criteria</a>：该来源强调目标必须 Measurable（「Quantifying, or at least suggesting, an indicator of progress」）、Assignable（「Defining responsibility clearly」）、Time-related（「Including a timeline for expected results」）。库存改善目标的常见违规是缺少 Assignable——目标挂在品类上但没人对品类负责。看板应强制每个改善条目带责任人字段，没有责任人的条目不允许进入清单。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与-s-op-的接口\">与 S&amp;OP 的接口</h3><p>库存健康看板的月度视角应接入 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sales_and_operations_planning\">S&amp;OP</a> 流程。按该来源，S&amp;OP 是「a set of decision-making processes to balance demand and supply, to integrate financial planning and operational planning」，其核心输出是「the integration of the plans of Marketing, Sales, Operations and Finance」。库存看板正是这个整合的输入之一——它把「当前库存健康度」与「未来需求计划」放到一起，让市场、销售、运营、财务用同一组数字讨论。如果看板不进 S&amp;OP，库存问题会永远停留在供应链内部，无法获得市场与财务侧的资源支持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>看板的目标是让会议十分钟内决定「谁最差、差在哪、动作有无效果」，不是展示最多指标。</li>\n<li>三层金字塔结构：分档结果 → 维度分解 → 明细证据，层间可下钻且能解释上一层数值。</li>\n<li>核心指标五类：周转、库龄结构、呆滞、服务、资金；每个指标必须带六项口径说明（含汇率与成本口径）。</li>\n<li>改善跟踪靠动作流水与指标在时间轴对齐，并用同类对照构造反事实基线。</li>\n<li>效果验证窗口按品类动销周期设定，结论必须允许「无法判定」这一类。</li>\n<li>有效动作要提炼为可复用规则，对应 DMAIC 的 Control 阶段，防止改善成为重复劳动。</li>\n<li>看板服务日会/周会/月度经营会三个节奏，共用一份数据；月度视角接入 S&amp;OP 以获取跨职能资源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"品类/仓库健康看板与改善跟踪","id":"品类-仓库健康看板与改善跟踪"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"指标集的取舍","id":"指标集的取舍"},{"level":3,"text":"五维核心指标","id":"五维核心指标"},{"level":3,"text":"指标必须带口径说明","id":"指标必须带口径说明"},{"level":3,"text":"避免的指标","id":"避免的指标"},{"level":2,"text":"改善跟踪的机制","id":"改善跟踪的机制"},{"level":3,"text":"动作流水与效果的关联","id":"动作流水与效果的关联"},{"level":3,"text":"效果验证的窗口","id":"效果验证的窗口"},{"level":3,"text":"改善的复利：把有效动作沉淀为规则","id":"改善的复利-把有效动作沉淀为规则"},{"level":2,"text":"组织节奏与会议设计","id":"组织节奏与会议设计"},{"level":3,"text":"三个节奏","id":"三个节奏"},{"level":3,"text":"目标设定的规范化","id":"目标设定的规范化"},{"level":3,"text":"与 S&OP 的接口","id":"与-s-op-的接口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"库存预警推送与责任人闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/recommendation-dashboard/inventory-alert-owner-workflow"},"next":null}